<title>USA: Globalstar sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Globalstar sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globalstar Telecommunications Ltd said on Tuesday that its board voted for a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid on May 28, 1997, to shareholders of record as of May 12, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Globalstar is developing and will deploy a worldwide, wireless digital telecommunication service, to be initiated in late 1998, through a constellation of 48 low-earth-orbit satellites.</p>
</text>
